    "At 12 o'clock, on my",
    "22d birthday, Alice",
    "and I were married.",
    "She made an ideally",
    "beautiful bride; and",
    "it was a lovely",
    "wedding. We came on",
    "for the night to",
    "Springfield, where I had",
    "taken a suite of rooms",
    "for the night.",
    "Our intense happiness",
    "is too sacred to be",
    "written about"
